# Strom Fire Tor Expert Bundle config — full-auto circuit rotation.
# Copy this file next to tor.exe (or let start-tor-expert.bat do it).
# WARNING: unauthenticated control port. Localhost-only — never expose 9050/9051 to a network.

SocksPort 9050
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 0
# Faster circuit turnover for rotation testing (Tor default is ~10 min).
# Strom Fire rotates on demand with NEWNYM, which works regardless of these —
# they only affect Tor's own background rotation. Values like 1s exist online
# but churn circuits constantly: slower tests and needless load on volunteer
# relays. 60/30 is the sane middle ground.
MaxCircuitDirtiness 60
NewCircuitPeriod 30
DataDirectory .\tor-data
